cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this pipeline or data, please cite both the software repository
  and the associated peer-reviewed article below.
title: Shotgun metagenomic analysis pipeline for the gut microbiome of antibiotic-treated Mystus cavasius
abstract: >-
  Bioinformatics pipeline (quality control, host-read removal, taxonomic
  classification, metagenome assembly, and diversity/visualisation in R) used to
  profile the gut microbiome of oxytetracycline-treated Mystus cavasius by
  shotgun metagenomics.
